{"id":"03089c3cefed4872","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness.md","title":"Uniqueness of Modal Fixed Points","display":"lem-fixed-point-uniqueness — Uniqueness of Modal Fixed Points","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness","aliases":["89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness"],"display":"lem-fixed-point-uniqueness — Uniqueness of Modal Fixed Points","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","[[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]]","[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]]","[[89-lem-gl-normal]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fixed-point-uniqueness — Uniqueness of Modal Fixed Points"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"251691cede4cbc3e\" href=\"?note=251691cede4cbc3e\" title=\"89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness\">89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fae50ce87c0c5e77\" href=\"?note=fae50ce87c0c5e77\" title=\"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl\">89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ccac24cdfa254e90\" href=\"?note=ccac24cdfa254e90\" title=\"89-lem-gl-normal\">89-lem-gl-normal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}\\)</span> 使用原有弱不动点集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为正规逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 104、122；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>选择不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\">\\(A,B,C\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>，在 Bernardi 引理中同时代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:=B,q:=C\">\\(p:=B,q:=C\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\">\\(B,C\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 的新鲜性使两次单独代入与同时代入在此相同。两条弱方程及其必然化使前件成为定理，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\leftrightarrow C\">\\(B\\leftrightarrow C\\)</span> 可证。这个证明直接来自唯一性引理，不再依赖已证明的不动点存在性，因此不会在第三种存在证明中造成回环。一般未模态化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=p\">\\(A=p\\)</span> 不满足此唯一性结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness","status":"resolved","id":"251691cede4cbc3e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl","status":"resolved","id":"fae50ce87c0c5e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-normal","status":"resolved","id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-normal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"A,B,C","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"p:=B,q:=C","display":false},{"tex":"B,C","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"B\\leftrightarrow C","display":false},{"tex":"A=p","display":false}],"bytes":1345,"backlinks":[{"id":"636cbfa2301b039f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9d2a6862fd2083e6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b66c5788afda7d6d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d02a2af901e8720d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"判据与唯一性：[[89-df-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]；[[89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality]] → [[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]。"}],"outgoing":["02536e2efd437c59","251691cede4cbc3e","fae50ce87c0c5e77","ccac24cdfa254e90"]}